.TH DANBY-HELIUMBURNING 1
.SH NAME
danby-heliumburning \- helium-burning reaction network
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/heliumburning
.SH MODEL
Triple-alpha reactions convert helium to carbon; subsequent captures form
oxygen and heavier products. Temperature and density scale rates while a
cooling term removes accumulated thermal energy.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/heliumburning.b
